                   <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceLocator> "JRC Section 9.2.1, printed page 110, lines 2895-2900; Annex 13.10.2, Tables 177 and 180, printed pages 486-491; captions at lines 11873 and 11879; supporting text on printed page 484, lines 11853-11859."@en ;
                   <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceType> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#adaptedDefinition> .


###  https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#FibreStrength
:FibreStrength rdf:type owl:Class ;
               rdfs:subClassOf :MechanicalFibreCharacteristic ;
